m?t=1749576892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611010/extras/f76f585fb1c4d859197106ffbd44a9b7.mp4?t=1749576892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Narrative Design:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adult themes, dramatic character arcs, and a branching storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time &amp; Weather System:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycles and evolving weather influence both the city and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1980s Aesthetic:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual style that captures the spirit of the era with old-school pixel art and analog textures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611010/extras/eb42c25874ba876547b32ffd02f25023.webp?t=1749576892\" width=323 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Ballad of Bullets contains mature content including violence, sexual themes, substance use, and strong language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is intended for players 18 years and older.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0Any discriminatory, sexist, or racist content within the game world is purely fictional and does not reflect the views of the developers.</p>",
